  abilityId: 1820378
  abilityName: "Deluxe\_Goshogawara\_Bomber"
  abilityDesc: 22 combo powerful Water attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), enormously boosts own critical hit rate, greatly restores HP for 3 turns,
    hugely boosts Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns, enormously boosts critical hit rate
    for 3 turns, considerably boosts Atk, Def, Rec of Water types for 3 turns, hugely
    boosts Water elemental damage for 3 turns & probability of activating BB/SBB/UBB
    twice for 1 turn
